      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"PACSIntegrationandSupport-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><div>Bahmni provides the ability to integrate with PACS to send radiology orders and access fulfillments (radiology images) via a link to the DICOM web viewer. <span>The integration with PACS has two main functions :</span></div><div><ol><li>Send the radiology order created in Bahmni to PACS server.</li><li>Provide the ability to view the image stored in PACS against the corresponding radiology order. </li></ol></div><h2 id=\"PACSIntegrationandSupport-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">The orders are usually placed by doctors and sometimes by other staff on behalf of the doctor based on pre-decided protocols. The radiology images are seen by Doctors for diagnostic purposes.</span></p><h2 id=\"PACSIntegrationandSupport-HowisitUsed?\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;line-height: 1.5;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></h2><h3 id=\"PACSIntegrationandSupport-Step1:PlacetheRadiologyOrder\">Step 1: Place the Radiology Order</h3><p>Select an option from the radiology Orders section of the Orders Tab. This will send the radiology order to the PACS server.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.10.40%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844343&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=720&amp;height=383\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.10.40%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844343&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"45776917\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-03 at 3.10.40 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014462\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"e3bc0cba-610a-4dfc-8350-d0d05cb1de38\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.10.40%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844343&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1440&amp;height=766 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.10.40%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844343&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=720&amp;height=383 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Image 1: Screen to place Radiology Orders</strong></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"PACSIntegrationandSupport-Step2:AccesstheRadiologyImage\">Step 2: Access the Radiology Image</h3><p>After the XRay is taken, the radiology image can be automatically accessed from the &quot;Digital Radiology&quot; widget on the  Radiology Orders screen (Image 2). The Radiology images will be displayed using the inbuilt DICOM viewer (Image 3).</p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.00.25%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844404&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=118\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.00.25%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844404&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"45776918\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-03 at 3.00.25 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014462\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"4ab965cf-14b9-4f44-aef8-4ab0ca161b8e\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.00.25%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844404&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1250&amp;height=212 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.00.25%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844404&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=118 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong><strong style=\"text-align: center;\">Image 2: </strong>Digital Radiology widget with links to access Radiology Images</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong><br/></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.03.37%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844422&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=410&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.03.37%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844422&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"45776919\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-03 at 3.03.37 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014462\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"9de9689d-be2c-4a21-9642-f8f88c418550\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.03.37%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844422&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=820&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014462/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-03%20at%203.03.37%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1457676844422&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=410&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><strong style=\"text-align: center;\">Image 3: </strong>Radiology Images seen in a DICOM viewer</strong></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"fe9e777b-789d-44be-99a5-88941280217a\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"65bcd094-3170-4acc-835e-79811fed06dd\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604202/Radiology+and+PACS\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604202\" data-linked-resource-version=\"15\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Radiology and PACS - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Implemnentation Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014588/Radiology+and+PACS+Integration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014588\" data-linked-resource-version=\"48\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Radiology and PACS - Implementer's Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
